REQUIRED DELIVERABLES:

A. React identity and key inventory.
B. Unstable key findings.
C. Unexpected remount risks.
D. State preservation defects.
E. Recommended key conventions.
F. Component-specific acceptance criteria.
G. Regression test scenarios.

Use actual source evidence and runtime warnings where available.
Do not invent rendering defects.
Do not modify components.

```

